      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Being able to hear how far a sound is can be very important for specific avatars, but ruins them when the range is so short. Genuinely a few avatars aren't as good anymore. Please take Yukari's comment into account",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
